      "writtenOn": "2025-06-13T04:23:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After discussed with Zhiyuan, seems only checking these two opcode is not enough, but also needs to consider the condition jump. Rather than checking the opcode to determine if needs to patch pkvm or not at here, an alternative is to patch pkvm inside the for loop of the apply_retpoline and apply_return, so that we can leverage the opcode check conditions, which is more comprehensive. Then the patch_pkvm can be demoted to 829~844 lines of code, without a for loop and opcode checking.",
